      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>A frost-side ambush unit: a dead fisher of the Greywake crews, woken wrong on the ice and still working its old ground. They wear Greywake colors; Grandaunt Ulla will want them brought home <em>gently</em>. Five rime-woken fishers plus two ice mephits rising out of paper ice at dusk is a solid Medium-Hard ambush for a level 9-10 party, and the thin-ice terrain is the real monster.</p>",
